<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Corp proposes bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Keppel Corp proposes bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping conglomerate Keppel Corporation Ltd said on Tuesday it was proposing a 1-for-4 bonus share issue to reward shareholders.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
